1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.215
Ensonga lwaki okwekenneenya obutuli obuddugavu obw’amaaso mu kulabirirwa kw’amaaso okusookerwako kwe kulaba oba waliwo ekirabika

2
00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:14.431
obujulizi bw’obulwadde, gamba ng’okuzimba amaaso oba okulumwa, n’okulaba oba akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso ekwatagana n’ekitangaala ekimasamasa.

3
00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:21.245
Kino kitutegeeza oba obusimu bw’amaaso oba retina emabega w’eriiso bulamu bulungi.

4
00:00:21.245 --> 00:00:26.857
Tandika ng’onnyonnyola ky’ogenda okukola era okebere omulwadde nti musanyufu.

5
00:00:26.857 --> 00:00:32.269
Olwo tunuulira amaaso olabe oba obutuli obuddugavu obw’amaaso ziddugavu, zeetooloovu ate...

6
00:00:32.269 --> 00:00:37.680
kyenkana, era bwe wabaawo obubonero obulala bwonna ng’okuzimba amaaso oba okugwa, .

7
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.033
ekibikka ky’amaaso.

8
00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:43.680
Olwo amataala mu kisenge olwo ne bakebera obutereevu akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso response n’ettaala eyakaayakana

9
00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.524
nga banoonya okuzibikira okw’amangu era okweyoleka.

10
00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:50.080
Singa kino kibaawo olwo obusimu bw’amaaso ne retina

11
00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.642
emabega w’eriiso byolekedde okuba nga biramu bulungi.

12
00:00:53.642 --> 00:00:56.880
Singa akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso eremererwa okuziyiza olwo wabaawo ekiyinza okubaawo

13
00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:01.714
okubeera obulwadde bw’obusimu bw’amaaso nga glaucoma oba retina nga

14
00:01:01.714 --> 00:01:03.440
nga okwekutula oba okuzibikira

15
00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.122
okuweebwa omusaayi.

16
00:01:04.122 --> 00:01:09.920
Kiyinza okuba ekizibu okulaba akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso enjeru ku iris eya kitaka enzirugavu era bw’otyo ojja

17
00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.789
balina okuyingira okumpi.

18
00:01:11.789 --> 00:01:15.900
Bwe kiba nga kiramu akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso erina okukonziba amangu era nga kyeyoleka bulungi okutuuka ku kitangaala

19
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.695
ekitangaala mu kisenge ekizibu.

20
00:01:17.695 --> 00:01:22.720
Ne mu liiso lino nga lirina akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso enjeru enzirugavu olw’okuzimba amaaso ga akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso

21
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.320
alina okuba nga akyalina okukonziba wadde ng’akawuka ka amaaso kasita obusimu bw’amaaso n’amaaso g’amaaso ku

22
00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.104
emabega w’eriiso biba bulamu bulungi.

23
00:01:31.104 --> 00:01:35.480
Singa akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso ekoma katono era mpola olwo awo

24
00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:39.431
kiyinza okuba obulwadde emabega w’eriiso n’okulaba

25
00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:40.560
ebiva mu kulongoosebwa amaaso

26
00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.782
ayinza okuba nga mwavu.

27
00:01:41.782 --> 00:01:47.080
Bwe akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso okuddamu tekuliiwo ddala, omukisa gw'okulongoosa okulaba oluvannyuma

28
00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.666
okulongoosa amaaso kitono nnyo.

29
00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:54.320
Jjukira nti bw’oba weetegereza akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso, sooka otunule okukakasa

30
00:01:54.320 --> 00:02:00.480
Kiddugavu, kyetooloovu era kyenkana olwo mu kisenge ekizibu ennyo ne kikola mangu

31
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:03.120
era nga kirabika eri ekitangaala ekimasamasa.
